[strategy/guidance/application/design-tokens/GUID-APP-UI-001-design-tokens-theming-guidance.md#layer-1--primitive-tokens]

#### Layer 1 — Primitive Tokens

Raw palette — all available colors. **Not used directly in components** — only referenced by semantic tokens.

```css
/* core-theme.css — Primitive tokens (excerpt) */
:root {
  /* Gainwell brand */
  --gainwell-soft-black: #2b3a44;   /* Pantone 7546C — primary soft black */
  --gainwell-aqua-green: #00eeae;   /* Pantone 3395C — primary brand accent */
  --gainwell-blue:       #0062ff;   /* Primary interactive blue */

  /* Neutral scale */
  --neutral-0:   #ffffff;
  --neutral-100: #fafafa;
  --neutral-200: #eff0f6;
  --neutral-300: #dee2e6;
  --neutral-400: #ced4da;
  --neutral-500: #8e99a8;
  --neutral-600: #5a6978;
  --neutral-700: var(--gainwell-soft-black);
  --neutral-800: #000000;

  /* Blue scale */
  --blue-50:  #f6f9ff;   --blue-100: #e5efff;
  --blue-200: #99c0ff;   --blue-300: #3381ff;
  --blue-400: var(--gainwell-blue);
  --blue-500: #1854d6;   --blue-600: #1f46af;   --blue-700: #1e2b66;

  /* Status palettes: --green-*, --red-*, --yellow-*, --orange-*, --pink-*, --purple-*, --mint-* */
}
```

