[strategy/guidance/application/design-tokens/GUID-APP-UI-001-design-tokens-theming-guidance.md#anti-patterns-to-avoid]

### Anti-Patterns to Avoid

```tsx
// ❌ AVOID — hardcoded color values bypass the token system
<div className="bg-[#1e40af] text-[#ffffff]">...</div>

// ✅ USE — semantic token classes
<div className="bg-primary text-primary-foreground">...</div>

// ❌ AVOID — Tailwind palette classes bypass semantic tokens (not theme-aware)
<div className="bg-blue-600 text-white dark:bg-blue-400">...</div>

// ✅ USE — semantic token reference
<div className="bg-primary text-primary-foreground">...</div>

// ❌ AVOID — inline style overrides for theming
<div style={{ backgroundColor: '#1e40af' }}>...</div>

// ✅ USE — CSS custom property via token
<div className="bg-primary">...</div>
```

